Package: ntfs-3g-plugin-dedup
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: junglivre <junglivre@users.noreply.github.com>
Provides: pve-file-restore-ntfs3g-plugin (= 2)
Depends: libntfs-3g89t64, ntfs-3g
Description: Windows Server Data Deduplication plugin for ntfs-3g
 Read-only ntfs-3g plugin for the Windows Server Data Deduplication reparse
 point 0x80000013 (including format 0x0103). ntfs-3g loads it automatically
 when it encounters a deduplicated file.
 .
 Every chunk is checked against the SHA-512 digest in its stream map, and a
 read that cannot be completed and checked fails with EIO: it never returns
 wrong or truncated data.
 .
 Built from smx-smx/ntfs-3g-dedup-plugin with patches for FUSE 3 and for big
 files. Upstream is GPL-2.0-only; see
 /usr/share/doc/ntfs-3g-plugin-dedup/copyright.
